    "The Gerindra Party continues to build cross-factional support for its candidate while other parties remain in consultation processes."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The political discourse surrounding the selection of a vice president to accompany President Prabowo has intensified with widespread support emerging for Sugiono. Political factions such as NasDem, Golkar, and PAN have expressed varying degrees of support or alignment, while members of the DPD RI have also voiced their backing, specifically noting his capacity to represent the needs of the electorate. Internally, the Gerindra Party is actively working to consolidate support across different parliamentary factions. While some parties like Demokrat are still weighing their options between potential candidates, others have emphasized their commitment to following the president's direction. Supporters cite Sugiono's loyalty and professional experience as key assets for the position. Discussions have also emerged regarding the voting mechanism, with some stakeholders calling for an open vote within the MPR to finalize the selection.",
